<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Intel '97 estimate said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Intel '97 estimate said cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs cut 1997 profit estimates for the world's largest chipmaker, Intel Corp, on Thursday, according to market sources.</p>
<p>-- Goldman analyst Rajiv Chaudhri, who was not immediately available to comment, cut his 1997 profit estimate to $8.50 from $8.70, the sources said. He left his 1998 profit estimates unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Intel shares closed at 147-1/2 on the Nasdaq on Wednesday.</p>
